    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but kindness doesnt change the fact that my life is over. the career, the reputation, the friendships... its all gone. it's like i'm just waiting for the rest of my life to catch up to the fact that i don't even exist to society anymore. there's nothing left to go back to.",
